<BaseLayout title="Manufacturing | BallValve"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><Breadcrumb current="Manufacturing" /><p class="eyebrow">MANUFACTURING</p><h1 class="title">Precision made.<br /><em>Clearly proven.</em></h1><p>From incoming material to final testing, every step is designed for consistency and traceability.</p></div></section><section class="section container prose"><h2>Control starts with material</h2><p>Critical pressure-containing parts use traceable materials, verified for chemical composition and mechanical properties before machining. CNC equipment and dedicated fixtures control the fit of balls, seats, and seals.</p><h2>Production organized for project delivery</h2><p>Each valve has an individual manufacturing record. Process, inspection, test, and packing stages are linked to project documents for audits, acceptance, and lifecycle support.</p></section><InquiryCTA /></BaseLayout>
